@AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### ── Address Validation ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Validate a well-formed US address
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressLines": ["7 barnwell dr, M1V1y7, on can"],
  "regionCode": "CA"
}

###

### Validate with a typo to see spell-correction behavior
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/validate-address
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressLines": ["1600 Amphitheatre Parkwayy", "Mountain View, CA 94043"],
  "regionCode": "US"
}

###

### ── Geocoding API ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Geocode a full address
GET {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/geocode?address=1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA

###

### Geocode with region bias and language
GET {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/geocode?address=56731 smith st, oshawa,l1j6m3,on,can&region=ca&language=en

###

### Geocode filtered by components (postal code lookup)
GET {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/geocode?address=Toronto&components=country:CA|postal_code:M1V1Y7

###

### ── Places API (New) — Text Search ──────────────────────────────────────

### Text search — find coffee shops in Mountain View
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/text-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "textQuery": "Marydale",
  "languageCode": "en",
  "regionCode": "CA",
  "maxResultCount": 5
}

###

### Text search — biased toward a specific location (Times Square, NYC)
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/text-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "textQuery": "pizza",
  "languageCode": "en",
  "maxResultCount": 5,
  "biasLatitude": 40.7580,
  "biasLongitude": -73.9855,
  "biasRadiusMeters": 1000
}

###

### Text search — restaurants in Canada
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/text-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "textQuery": "sushi restaurants in Toronto",
  "languageCode": "en",
  "regionCode": "CA",
  "maxResultCount": 10
}

###

### ── Places API (New) — Nearby Search ───────────────────────────────────

### Nearby search — restaurants within 500m of Google HQ
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/nearby-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 37.4221,
  "longitude": -122.0841,
  "radiusMeters": 500,
  "includedTypes": ["restaurant"],
  "maxResultCount": 10,
  "languageCode": "en"
}

###

### Nearby search — cafes or bakeries within 1km
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/nearby-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 37.4221,
  "longitude": -122.0841,
  "radiusMeters": 1000,
  "includedTypes": ["cafe", "bakery"],
  "maxResultCount": 10
}

###

### Nearby search — no type filter (returns anything nearby)
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/nearby-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 37.4221,
  "longitude": -122.0841,
  "radiusMeters": 200,
  "maxResultCount": 5
}

###

### ── Places API (New) — Place Details ───────────────────────────────────
# Replace the place ID below with one returned from a text-search or
# nearby-search call above (the "id" field on a place).

### Place details — full details for a place ID
GET {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/places/ChIJkUad8HmRLIgRkq6h_ykiX2Q?languageCode=en&regionCode=CA

###

### ── Mapbox Search Box — Suggest (step 1 of 2) ──────────────────────────
# session_token must be a UUID generated by the client and reused across
# the suggest + retrieve pair to group billing correctly.

### Suggest — partial address query
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/mapbox/suggest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "109 Marydale",
  "sessionToken": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
  "country": "CA",
  "language": "en",
  "limit": 5
}

###

### Suggest — with proximity bias (results near Toronto)
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/mapbox/suggest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Marydale",
  "sessionToken": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
  "country": "CA",
  "language": "en",
  "limit": 5,
  "proximityLongitude": -78.9,
  "proximityLatitude": 43.9
}

###

### Suggest — filter to addresses only (types filter)
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/mapbox/suggest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "109 Marydale",
  "sessionToken": "0289b2fe-9896-4831-89f5-d40c68f0313c",
  "country": "CA",
  "language": "en",
  "limit": 5,
  "types": ["address"]
}

###

### ── Mapbox Search Box — Retrieve (step 2 of 2) ──────────────────────────
# Replace the mapbox_id below with one returned from a suggest call above.

### Retrieve — get full details for a suggestion
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/mapbox/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mapboxId": "dXJuOm1ieGFkcjpkMTI1MDUyYy04NDllLTQ5MjgtYjY2Yy00MDEzYjEwZjNjZTk",
  "sessionToken": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890"
}

###

### ── Mapbox Search Box — Forward Search (single step) ───────────────────

### Forward search — full address, no two-step flow needed
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/mapbox/forward-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "109 Marydale Avenue, Whitby, Ontario",
  "sessionToken": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
  "country": "CA",
  "language": "en",
  "limit": 3
}

###

### Forward search — global query
POST {{AddressValidationPoc_HostAddress}}/api/mapbox/forward-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy, Mountain View, CA",
  "sessionToken": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012",
  "language": "en",
  "limit": 3
}
